  "question": {
    "text": "<strong>Paragraph:</strong>\nThere are $n$ urns each containing $(n+1)$ balls such that the ith urn contains $i$ white balls and $(n+1-i)$ red balls. Let $u_i$ be the event of selecting ith urn, $i=1,2,3, \\ldots, n$ and $W$ denotes the event of getting a white balls.<strong>Question:</strong>\nIf $P\\left(u_i\\right)=c$, where $c$ is a constant, then $P\\left(u_i / W\\right)$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "ZEesU",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{2}{n+1}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2JroW",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{1}{n+1}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2ABai",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{n}{n+1}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "8WkQ1",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{1}{2}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$P\\left(\\frac{u_i}{W}\\right)=\\frac{\\frac{n}{n+1}}{\\frac{\\Sigma i}{n+1}}=\\frac{2}{n+1}$",
    "image": null
  },
